Package: mazemuncher
Title: Maze Muncher, an Original Maze-Chase Game Built with 'shiny'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Rico",
           family = "Derks",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "r.j.e.derks@lumc.nl")
Description: An original arcade maze-chase game delivered as a 'golem'
    'shiny' application. A hungry blob munches seeds through neon mazes while
    four sentries with distinct targeting personalities hunt it down. The
    real-time game loop runs in the browser on an HTML canvas, while R
    supplies the mazes (hand-made and procedurally generated), difficulty
    curves, level progression and a persistent high-score table.
