    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    bslib,
    config,
    golem,
    shiny,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
